description	"Luke Skywalker

^9Weapons:
- Melee
^2-- RoF: 1.11x
- Lightsaber ^9(Yellow/Red/Blue)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (1)
-- Blaster Deflect (1)
-- Damage: 240/^1300/^2130
^2-- Spec Damage: 1.25x

^3Abilities:
- Saber Throw ^3[Saber CS1]
^2-- Damage: 40
- Gunkick ^3[No Melee CS2]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS3]

^5Force Powers:
- Sense (1)

^6Items:
- Electrobinoculars

^8Attributes:
- Force Focus (3)
- Healing (1)
- Dexterity (1)

The first of the new Jedi. Every step of his hero's journey is now yours to take."